The `CookieOptions` type in Hono defines optional properties for cookie configuration including `maxAge` (number), `httpOnly` (boolean), `secure` (boolean), `sameSite` (union of 'Strict' | 'Lax' | 'None' with case variants), and `path` (string). These are combined with `PartitionedCookieConstraint` via intersection.

