The `getCookie` and `setCookie` functions are exported from the cookie helper module (`dist/types/helper/cookie/index.d.ts`) as standalone utility functions, not as methods on the Context prototype. `getCookie` takes a `Context` and optional key/prefix options to retrieve cookies, while `setCookie` takes a `Context`, name, value, and optional options to set a cookie.

